msgctxt "80"
msgid "What the hell...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry I had to do that. Now start talking about the\r\n"
"Reapers. I want details."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"But I don't know anything! And I sure as hell don't know\r\n"
"any of these details you're lookin' for!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "I don't buy that. You'd better start talking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"I'm at the very bottom of the heap! I don't even know\r\n"
"who the boss is, I swear!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Look, I got kicked out of my family for missing a mark, and\r\n"
"then some guy I met asked me to join, so I did. That's it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "This guy you met wasn't the boss?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"No! Someone else is in charge! I don't even know the name\r\n"
"of the guy who recruited me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"(He's been talking up a storm, but he's not giving me any\r\n"
"real info. Guess that means he probably is just an\r\n"
"underling, just like he says.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "(I better turn him over to Ibuki now.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "This oughta be a good place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "So where's this thing you were talking about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Heh... Perfect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "What do you say? Fascinating, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "Are these guys Reapers, too?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"Nah, I'm the only one. These guys are just here to help\r\n"
"me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "Help me give you a good pummeling, that is! Hahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "And what do you hope to accomplish by doing that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid ""
"Don't you get it? We're taking you hostage. Then, we're\r\n"
"gonna crush the HLA!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid ""
"I knew somebody would be coming to see me if I leaked some\r\n"
"info about myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "You walked straight into my trap. Too bad for you, dickhead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "I see. It's definitely a very clever trap."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "Too bad it's not going to work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "Hahaha! Get a load of this joker!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "I guess we'll just see about that, huh!?"
msgstr ""

